{"3856500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Qubx 2", "steam_appid": 3856500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5010180], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Qubx 2 is a fast, reflex-first action puzzler. Rotate a cube in 3D to line its faces up with the geometric shapes racing toward it and clear them clean, as the tempo rises and the neon vaporwave world pulses around every match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run sends you through escalating chapters where the rules shift under you and powerups bend how the cube and the field behave, so no two attempts play out the same. Build a run, spend what you earn, and see how deep you get before it catches you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick Play strips it back to the pure test. One cube, an endless stream of shapes, and a speed curve that only goes up. It rewards reading shapes early, committing to a rotation, and staying composed as the field accelerates. Easy to pick up, unforgiving at pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Underneath both is the same feel: sharp controls, readable geometry, and a difficulty that respects your reactions. Full controller support, a driving original soundtrack, and a look that leans hard into neon and motion.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Qubx 2 is a fast, reflex-first action puzzler. Rotate a cube in 3D to line its faces up with the geometric shapes racing toward it and clear them clean, as the tempo rises and the neon vaporwave world pulses around every match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run sends you through escalating chapters where the rules shift under you and powerups bend how the cube and the field behave, so no two attempts play out the same. Build a run, spend what you earn, and see how deep you get before it catches you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick Play strips it back to the pure test. One cube, an endless stream of shapes, and a speed curve that only goes up.